+## Symbolic links
+
+Symbolic links stored in `.zip` and `.sqfs` archives are skipped by
+default. Use `-l`/`--links` to expose them, following the convention of
+the [local backend](/local/#symlinks): each link is listed under its
+name plus the `.rclonelink` suffix, its size is the length of the target
+and reading it returns the target path. A regular archive member whose
+name happens to end in `.rclonelink` stays a regular file.
+
+This means `rclone copy --links :archive:test.zip dest:` recreates the
+links as symbolic links on a destination which supports them.
+
